        "pf_baa12b85_value": "ThePhotoStick® is compatible with nearly all modern computers using Windows and Mac Operating Systems:<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Windows</span>: Windows XP, Windows Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, and Windows 10.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Mac</span>: Mac OS X Version 10.7 and later.<br>",
        "pf_cabc03df_value": "No, that’s what makes it so great! ThePhotoStick® does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>ThePhotoStick® comes with everything it needs — you simply need to plug it into an available USB slot and it’s ready to run.",
